         <gmd:abstract>
            <gco:CharacterString>The Australian Water Outlook (AWO) is the Australian Bureau of Meteorology's hydrological service that gives users access to comprehensive, Australia-wide, nationally consistent hydroclimate data at multiple timescales—historical water balance information, seasonal forecasts, and hydrological projections out to the end of the century. </gco:CharacterString>
         </gmd:abstract>
